n the underlying common-stock price (S).","source_id":"cb_calamos_2003_convertible_arbitrage"},{"chunk_hash":"834ae1b123738b60e5d1e1c1a09c41767bff9374213356771e8430f1eef484b0","chunk_id":"cb_hull_2022_options_futures_derivatives_11ed:p242:0371","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[242,242],"quote":"They are therefore bonds with an embedded call option on the company’s stock.","source_id":"cb_hull_2022_options_futures_derivatives_11ed"}],"id":"cb-greeks-delta-gamma-vega","reading_id":"08_convertible_bonds","schema_version":"cacg.v0","summary":"Convertible Greeks: Delta, Gamma, Vega — placeholder summary                    ","tags":["convertible-bonds","greeks-delta"],"title":"Convertible Greeks: Delta, Gamma, Vega"},"is_retracted":false,"new_card_hash":"529ca7bd44659b6c95f202d6abd9c6b8b96ed8ebf86d3cbd45640a3a87d8b095","prev_card_hash":null,"prev_checksum":null,"schema_version":"cacg.v0","seq":0,"timestamp":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z"}
